monstera deliciosa
- bright indirect light, no afternoon sun (leaves scorched last June)
- top 3 cm of soil dry -> soak. about once a week in summer.
- wipe the leaves once a month, they collect dust
- moss pole added in March, aerial roots tucked in
- new leaf every ~4 weeks in summer; the newest one has 6 fenestrations
- feed half-strength fertiliser monthly Apr-Sep
